  element: wind
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 1
  initalLines:
  - Hello! Hi!
  - "You\u2019re here for wind magic, right?"
  - "It\u2019s important to hone an idea of structure and your other senses, since
    you can\u2019t see it."
  - Control your wind magic to play the tune on the poster over there.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Enchanting!
  - " Let\u2019s try it again, as a duet."
  afterBattleLines:
  - "With just a little more refinement, you\u2019ll be an expert."
  - "Try this pattern\u2026!"
  afterSpellLines:
  - Best of luck in your magical journey!
